{"synopsis":"Jun-ho mewarisi truk makanan milik mendiang pamannya, Deok-chun. Ia pun berkeliling negeri, memasak demi membuat nama “Go Deok-chun” dikenal secara nasional. Perjalanannya dimulai dengan Se-hee, pewaris keluarga konglomerat, dan berlanjut dengan pertemuan Jun-ho bersama para wanita di setiap daerah yang ia singgahi, masing-masing dengan kisahnya sendiri! Mereka semua jatuh hati padanya, namun satu hal yang benar-benar merebut hati Jun-ho… adalah memasak!\n\nIkuti perjalanan romantis Jun-ho yang tak tertahankan bersama truk makanannya keliling negeri—bisnis, dimulai!","alternative_title":"고덕춘의 푸드트럭","author":"Popo (III)","artist":"Popo (III)","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"5eb56824-fa61-4124-9301-9c4c3609bd13","number":"43","chapter":"43","title":"","date":"2026-08-02","released":"2026-08-02","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_db8dec25-87f8-4d07-b390-1906a7270a0c/chapter_ch_43/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_db8dec25-87f8-4d07-b390-1906a7270a0c/chapter_ch_43/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_db8dec25-87f8-4d07-b390-1906a7270a0c/chapter_ch_43/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_db8dec25-87f8-4d07-b390-1906a7270a0c/chapter_ch_43/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_db8dec25-87f8-4d07-b390-1906a7270a0c/chapter_ch_43/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_db8dec25-87f8-4d07-b390-1906a7270a0c/chapter_ch_43/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_db8dec25-87f8-4d07-b390-1906a7270a0c/chapter_ch_43/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_db8dec25-87f8-4d07-b390-1906a7270a0c/chapter_ch_43/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_db8dec25-87f8-4d07-b390-1906a7270a0c/chapter_ch_43/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_db8dec25-87f8-4d07-b390-1906a7270a0c/chapter_ch_43/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"6867e724-5041-4909-bb85-2608547b0a62","number":"42","chapter":"42","title":"","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_db8dec25-